        "owedBy": "sc-16015",
        "note": "~16 GB is descriptive prose, not a measurement: all three klein tier footprints carry null residentMemoryBytes. On the candle lane the same encoder runs F32 (~32 GB), so the cost is lane-dependent and needs measuring per lane."
